name: modl-url-slot-gotcha
mapping: commands
spec: 14
expect: bash
=== modl ===
#gl mapping=commands
# Unquoted /usr/bin/echo fills the URL slot, leaving only "hello" as the command text
a square /usr/bin/echo echo hello
# Quoted "/bin/cat" is not a URL slot; it starts the command text
b square "/bin/cat" -u
a -> b
=== bash ===
echo hello | "/bin/cat" -u
=== stderr ===
URL slot
